From 159296a140e7579c2eee3a02026dbf468410978c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 12:56:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Review fixes: docs apply order, M4/M6/M7 tests, cache v24,
 offline questions

Addresses gaps found reviewing the completed Phase 1 & 2:

- Docs: supabase/README.md and root README.md now list the full migration
  apply order (setup -> m1 -> m2 -> m4 -> m6 -> m7). Previously only m1 was
  documented, so a self-hoster would have had broken join-by-code,
  enroll-by-email, the mission editor and the scenario builder. Added an OAuth
  provider note and an explicit note that authored missions/scenarios are
  authoring-only (no student playback path yet).
- Tests: run.sh now applies every migration and runs a new M4/M6/M7 suite
  (enroll_by_email staff-only + student-role-forced + idempotent + unknown
  email; author-isolation of authored_missions and scenarios). Full suite
  passes: M1 (30) + M2 + M4/M6/M7.
- service-worker: cache bumped v23 -> v24 so returning/installed users pick up
  Phase 1 & 2; questions.json added to the precache so the 1000-question bank
  works offline.
- test-classroom-ui.js updated for the tabbed classroom (Join/Dashboard/Teach/
  Question bank) so npm run test:ui passes against the current UI.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
